{
  "format_version": 2,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "chapter": "prologue",
  "conversations": {
    "q_wake": {
      "default_source": "reported",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "q_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "q_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "醒啦？",
          "next": "p_who",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "met_q",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_who",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "……你是？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_3",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "asked_q_identity",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_3",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "Q。坐你旁边的。你真不记得了？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "who",
              "text": "抱歉，我没想起来。",
              "next": "q_who_1"
            },
            {
              "id": "day",
              "text": "现在几点了？",
              "next": "p_day"
            },
            {
              "id": "silent",
              "text": "（没接话。）",
              "next": "p_silent"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_who_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "行吧。你刚睡醒，脑子还没转过来。",
          "next": "q_who_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_who_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "反正马上要上生物课了。",
          "next": "p_biology"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_day",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "现在几点了？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_day_1",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "asked_q_date",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_day_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "快九点了。马上打第二遍铃。",
          "next": "q_day_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_day_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "第一节就是生物。",
          "next": "p_biology"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_silent",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（你没接话。）",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_silent_1",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "stayed_silent",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_silent_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "行，看来还没完全醒。",
          "next": "q_silent_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_silent_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "马上要上生物课了。",
          "next": "p_biology"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_biology",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "生物课？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_exam_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_exam_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "对啊。你不是最讨厌生物吗？上学期那次考试，你到底是没去，还是交了白卷？我有点记不清了。",
          "next": "q_exam_2",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "q_claims_blank_exam",
              "source": "reported",
              "speaker": "q",
              "text": "Q 记得你上学期的生物考试出了岔子，但他也说不清你究竟没进考场，还是交了白卷。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_exam_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你自己还有印象吗？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "blank",
              "text": "我交了白卷？",
              "next": "p_blank"
            },
            {
              "id": "absent",
              "text": "我没去考试？",
              "next": "p_absent"
            },
            {
              "id": "none",
              "text": "一点印象也没有。",
              "next": "p_none"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_blank",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "我交了白卷？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_blank_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_blank_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你当时好像是这么说的。也可能是我把两件事记混了。",
          "next": "q_exam_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_absent",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "我是没进考场？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_absent_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_absent_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你那天好像没进考场。具体怎么回事我也不清楚，后来你就不提了。",
          "next": "q_exam_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_none",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一点印象也没有。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_none_1",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "denied_exam_memory",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_none_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "嗯。你那阵子连课本都没怎么翻开过。",
          "next": "q_exam_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_exam_end",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "算了，反正今天又要上生物了。",
          "next": "q_topic_ask"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_topic_ask",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "老师今天说不定要提问。知识点背了没有？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "ask",
              "text": "提问？问什么？",
              "next": "p_topic"
            },
            {
              "id": "silent",
              "text": "（没有回答。）",
              "next": "p_topic_silent"
            },
            {
              "id": "search",
              "text": "（你低头翻找课本。）",
              "next": "p_topic_book"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_topic",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "提问？问什么？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_topic_answer"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_topic_answer",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "生态系统。",
          "next": "p_ecosystem_question"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_ecosystem_question",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "生态系统是什么？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_ecosystem"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ecosystem",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "就是一群生物，和它们待着的地方。谁吃谁，谁给谁遮阴，水和养分怎么绕一圈回来。书上会把这些写得很复杂。",
          "next": "p_ecosystem_reply"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_ecosystem_reply",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "听起来像是把一堆东西硬塞进一个词里。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_ecosystem_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ecosystem_end",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "差不多。你要是能把这句话说出来，老师大概也不会追着你问了。",
          "next": "q_end_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_topic_silent",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（没有回答。）",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_topic_silent"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_topic_silent",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "不说也行。反正老师还没来，没准今天根本不提问。",
          "next": "q_end_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_topic_book",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（你低头翻找课本。）",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_topic_book"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_topic_book",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "找课本？你不是一直带着吗？",
          "next": "q_end_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_end_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "先看看书包吧。你刚才还把它放在脚边。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.check_bag"
            }
          ],
          "next": "q_end_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_end_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "我也得找找我的笔了。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "q_after_bag": {
      "default_source": "reported",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "q_ab_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "q_ab_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "找到没有？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "told",
              "text": "课本不见了。",
