        },
        {
          "id": "q_told_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "怎么会？我早上还看见你把书包放在这儿。",
          "next": "q_told_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_told_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你再翻一遍吧，说不定压在练习册下面了。",
          "next": "q_ab_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_accused",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你拿了？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_accused_1",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "accused_q",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_accused_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "我？我连自己的东西都经常找不到。",
          "next": "q_accused_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_accused_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "再说，我拿你的生物书干什么？留着给你背吗？",
          "next": "q_ab_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_never",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（算了。）",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_never_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_never_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "好吧。那我就不问了。",
          "next": "q_ab_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ab_end",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "真问起来再说吧。先别急着把自己交代了。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
