          "text": "应该要用吧。备用课本放在哪儿，我也不清楚。",
          "next": "n_textbook_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "n_textbook_2",
          "speaker": "n",
          "text": "如果有人知道，可以自己去拿。我今天就不安排这个了。",
          "next": "n_turn"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_wait",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（你没说话。）",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "n_wait_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "n_wait_1",
          "speaker": "n",
          "text": "没人接话。N低头看了一眼名单，把它翻过来，又翻回去。",
          "next": "n_turn"
        },
        {
          "id": "n_turn",
          "speaker": "n",
          "text": "这样吧。今天这节课先不讲了。",
          "next": "n_turn_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "n_turn_2",
          "speaker": "n",
          "text": "想留在教室的就安静自习；想去操场活动也可以。别跑太远。",
          "next": "n_turn_3",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "class_dismissed",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.free_period"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "n_allows_free_period",
              "source": "reported",
              "speaker": "n",
              "text": "N 说这节课可以自习，也可以去操场活动。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "n_turn_3",
          "speaker": "n",
          "text": "我会待在这里。有事的话……再来问我。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "q_ask_along": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "qa_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "qa_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你总算想起我了？我还以为你打算一个人走到底。",
          "next": "qa_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "qa_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（Q 追上来，走到你身边。）",
